{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）早上10時許，警方接報西貢清水灣二灘有女泳客懷疑遇溺。人員到場時該名年約80歲的女泳客已被救上岸，惟昏迷不醒，隨即由救護車將她送往將軍澳醫院搶救。</p><p>警方正調查事主身分，案件列有人遇溺處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175400442411094016218365.jpeg/8YjjmKrCgY9KDv7xQhpnKTlj-PTyNx0D8_GKF9nxihc\"/><figcaption>警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175400694740422656719852.jpeg/36XIbZW10GMGtqYGFJi4xxS8gZIq8TSa-apORdyqTkU\"/><figcaption>警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175400697529765888905632.jpeg/biE91lBMXsM_uUPC2yPx0gcPc62dDFFUvr_aZ5u_2mc\"/><figcaption>警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"清水灣二灘有女泳客懷疑遇溺，送院搶救。（資料圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241013/922232748016930816068392.jpeg/68JHCr_2ey12aOPcBZrrpkSBzJFKIBCKfgZKNn4GSjY\"/><figcaption>清水灣二灘有女泳客懷疑遇溺，送院搶救。（資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T03:19:30.893431+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}